BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Paws for Tales
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T180000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-69fd0f2117731928001837d7@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a reluctant reader? Sign your child up for a sessi
 on to practice reading with a therapy dog at the library.\n\nStudies show 
 that children who may not want to read in front of their peers are much le
 ss anxious with an animal present. Children don't perceive animals as judg
 mental\, and reading to an animal helps them become more confident readers
 . We’d like to thank our partners for making this possible: Pet Assisted
  Therapy teams and their handlers from the Peninsula Humane Society & the 
 SPCA's Paws for Tales program.\n\nSpace is limited\, so register early for
  your 10-minute slot at smcl.org/pawsfortales! We do our best to incorpora
 te drop-ins as much as possible\, so feel free to stop by!\n\nAges: 6-11\n
 Registration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fd0f21
 17731928001837d7\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fd0f2117731928001837d7
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[B] VolunTEEN Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T163000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6a0b744ee13d3b4603b4aead@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Need some volunteer hours but don’t have a lot of time to co
 mmit? High school students can drop in to our library during this program 
 to help us with tasks such as program prep\, display help\, and research t
 asks. It’s a fun and easy way to make a difference in your community whi
 le hanging out with your friends. We’ll vouch for your time spent!\n\nAg
 es: 12-18\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/even
 ts/6a0b744ee13d3b4603b4aead\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Belmont
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a0b744ee13d3b4603b4aead
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] STEAM Team: Soap Carving
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T170000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6a31b20a72ddb736008171d7@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Today\, we'll be scientists\, engineers and beyond! Join us at
  the library every month for a new STEAM activity for you to explore. This
  time\, we’ll be creating our own unique soap sculpture using a bar of s
 oap and upcycled carving tools! No registration\, as supplies last.\n\nAge
 s: 6-11\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/ev
 ents/6a31b20a72ddb736008171d7\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a31b20a72ddb736008171d7
END:VEVENT
