BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Jr. Sewing Machine Basics (Ages 6-18)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T170000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6a4820c09c2405cf98ce9af8@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to dive into the wonderful world of sewing? Join
  us in the Atherton Makerspace every third Tuesday of the month for Jr. Se
 wing Machine Basics. If you're a curious beginner or just looking for a fu
 n new skill\, Jr. Sewing is the perfect starting point. This class is spe
 cifically designed for kids aged 6-18. We'll teach you the basics\, from t
 hreading a needle to winding a bobbin.\n\nWith hands-on practice\, kids wi
 ll also create a simple sewing project to take home\, leaving with new ski
 lls and something they made themselves.\n\nNo experience is needed. All ma
 terials will be provided. Space is limited\, so be sure to sign up online 
 at smcl.org or ask a staff member to assist you with registration.\n\nAges
 : 6-11\, 12-18\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons
 .com/events/6a4820c09c2405cf98ce9af8\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a4820c09c2405cf98ce9af8
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SC] Paws for Tales
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T180000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6a3ad25a0e851028002cab78@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a reluctant reader? Drop-in for your child up to h
 ave their own session to practice reading with a therapy dog at the librar
 y. \n\n Studies show that children who may not want to read in front of t
 heir peers are much less anxious with an animal present. Children don't pe
 rceive animals to be judgmental and reading to an animal helps them become
  more confident readers. We’d like to thank our partners for making this
  possible: Pet Assisted Therapy teams and their handlers from the Peninsul
 a Humane Society & the SPCA's Paws for Tales program.\n\nThis program is i
 ntended for children ages 6-11. Adults must be accompanied by a child.\n\n
 Ages: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/eve
 nts/6a3ad25a0e851028002cab78\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:San Carlos
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a3ad25a0e851028002cab78
END:VEVENT
