BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[B] Family Craft
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T163000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6949c27194297d3600a1378a@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to spend time together as a family? Join
  us for Family Craft\, a hands-on program specially designed for school-ag
 e youth and their families. Each session features a guided crafting activi
 ty that invites creativity\, connection\, and a whole lot of colorful fun.
 \n\nWhether you're a parent\, grandparent\, guardian\, or cool older sibli
 ng\, this is your chance to make something magical together. No crafting e
 xperience needed—just bring your imagination and a willingness to get a 
 little messy!\n\nAnd remember: in our world of googly eyes and glue sticks
 \, the process is just as important (if not more!) than the final masterpi
 ece. So\, embrace the crooked lines\, celebrate the unexpected\, and enjoy
  the creative ride.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: required\nSource: https:/
 /smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6949c27194297d3600a1378a\nLast synced: 2026
 -07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Belmont
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6949c27194297d3600a1378a
END:VEVENT
