DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T160000
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:smcl-6a171bedf6bd012f006aadf9@local-events
DESCRIPTION:This program is for ages 10 and older!\n\nWhen the zombie apoc
 alypse comes\, you’ll need to be ready. You’ll need to access all the 
 information necessary to survive and rebuild society in an offline world. 
 What better place to get that than at the library? On Wednesdays in July\,
  we'll learn a different survival skill each week and make something cool!
  Come to all sessions or just one. No registration required\, but please s
 how up on time as supplies may be limited.\nJuly 8 - solar ovensJuly 15 - 
 paracord braceletsJuly 22 - candles & fire safety foamJuly 29 - emergency 
 mini kits & duct tape crafts\n\nAges: 6-11\, 12-18\nRegistration: none\nSo
 urce: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a171bedf6bd012f006aadf9\nLast
  synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
