BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SM] Plot Twist Society
DTSTART:20260723T230000Z
DTEND:20260724T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:sanmateopl-LibCal-16089-16483092@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Plot Twist Society!\nJoin a super fun Book Club for all r
 eaders ages 10–13!\n\nThis month we’re diving into A Sea of Lemon Tree
 s by María Dolores Águila— a powerful and inspiring historical novel b
 ased on a true story. Set in California in 1930\, the book follows twelve-
 year-old Roberto Alvarez as he and his community stand up against injustic
 e when Mexican American students are unfairly segregated from their school
 . Told in vivid verse\, this unforgettable story celebrates courage\, pers
 everance\, and the power of people working together to create change.\n\n
 📅 When: Thursday\, July 23 · 4–5 PM\n📍 Where: Book Bubble\n\nBONU
 S: Register early and pick up a FREE copy of A Sea of Lemon Trees at the C
 hildren’s Reference Desk between June 25 and July 21 (while supplies las
 t).\n\nSpots are limited\, so don’t miss out! We can’t wait to see you
 !\n\nFor more information: \nContact: Madison Reece\nPhone: (650) 522-7836
 \nEmail: mreece@cityofsanmateo.org\n\nAges: 10-13\nSource: https://sanmate
 opublic.libcal.com/event/16483092\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
LOCATION:Book Bubble\, Main Library Children's Area
URL:https://sanmateopublic.libcal.com/event/16483092
END:VEVENT
