DTSTAMP:20260703T225103Z
UID:sanmateopl-LibCal-16089-16627241@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Let’s paint one of California’s most resilient native plan
 ts: cacti! Participants will paint rocks to resemble cacti and arrange the
 m in small planters to create a mini “cactus garden” to take home.\n\n
 This program is part of our Summer Art Lab series\, a three-part set of ha
 nds-on art programs exploring different creative techniques.\n\nPlease not
 e that paint will be used and projects may get messy. Participants are enc
 ouraged to wear appropriate clothing.\n\nSpace is limited to 15 participan
 ts. Registration is required.\n\nAges: unspecified\nSource: https://sanmat
 eopublic.libcal.com/event/16627241\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:51 PDT
